  <testcase classname="sensitive-data-logged" name="app/api/users/route.ts:11:18" time="0">
    <failure type="sensitive-data-logged" message="[medium] Sensitive data written to a log (likely)">Logs are copied into aggregators, retained for months, and readable by anyone with access to the logging system. A credential that reaches a log has left the application&apos;s trust boundary.
OWASP: A09:2021
CWE-532
Fix: Log that the attempt happened, not the credential.</failure>
  </testcase>
  <testcase classname="sensitive-data-logged" name="app/api/users/route.ts:14:18" time="0">
    <failure type="sensitive-data-logged" message="[medium] Sensitive data written to a log (likely)">Logs are copied into aggregators, retained for months, and readable by anyone with access to the logging system. A credential that reaches a log has left the application&apos;s trust boundary.
OWASP: A09:2021
CWE-532
Fix: Log that the attempt happened, not the credential.</failure>
